{"name":"GDLM 77 missing physics lab","desc":"For the probe mod: it plays our route and logs the game. One open physics question per station.","accept":{"dead air":"lab level: watch-only stations and labels, no gameplay to fill (tools/deadair.js)"},"lab":[{"n":1,"name":"mirror portal: jump inside","from":22,"to":44,"metrics":[{"m":"alive"},{"m":"launch","at":10}],"note":"sim: the mirror changes nothing in the physics: the same jump arc as outside (x keeps going right in world terms)"},{"n":2,"name":"mirror portal: jump outside (same spike)","from":44,"to":60,"metrics":[{"m":"alive"}],"note":"the same spike outside the mirror: its jump is the reference for station 1"},{"n":3,"name":"pink pad: cube","from":60,"to":76,"metrics":[{"m":"launch","at":64},{"m":"alive"}],"note":"no press: sim launches the cube at 0.65 of a yellow pad (vy 10.4), apex ~2.4 blocks. Read the touch step's vy in the log"},{"n":4,"name":"pink pad: ball","from":76,"to":94,"metrics":[{"m":"launch","at":82},{"m":"alive"}],"note":"no press: sim launches the ball at 0.65 x 0.6 of a yellow pad (vy 6.72)"},{"n":5,"name":"pink pad: ship","from":94,"to":114,"metrics":[{"m":"launch","at":101},{"m":"alive"}],"note":"no press: the ship rests on the floor, rolls over the pink pad: sim kicks it at 0.35 of a yellow pad","handsOff":true},{"n":6,"name":"pink orb launch","from":114,"to":130,"metrics":[{"m":"launch","at":120},{"m":"alive"}],"note":"the route taps the pink orb from the floor: sim launches at 0.72 of a jump (apex ~2.1 blocks over the orb). The lab video gave 0.5-0.63"},{"n":7,"name":"ship entry RISING","from":130,"to":154,"metrics":[{"m":"yAt","at":[136,138]},{"m":"alive"}],"note":"the pad throws the cube up through the ship portal: sim halves vy on entry (11.9 -> 5.8): y ~115 at the first ruler, ~103 at the second","handsOff":true},{"n":8,"name":"ship entry FALLING","from":154,"to":178,"metrics":[{"m":"yAt","at":[164,166]},{"m":"alive"}],"note":"the pad's arc comes down through the ship portal: sim halves vy (-8 -> -4): y ~34 at the first ruler, on the floor by the second. gdsolver's plans fit 0.25 on falling entries","handsOff":true},{"n":9,"name":"UFO: flaps over a spike row","from":178,"to":204,"metrics":[{"m":"accel"},{"m":"alive"}],"note":"sim: each flap sets vy 7 (gravity 0.086 / 0.129 falling); three flaps over the row. The log's vy on each press step answers it"},{"n":10,"name":"robot: held jump over a long gap","from":204,"to":228,"metrics":[{"m":"accel"},{"m":"alive"}],"note":"sim: jump 0.5x a cube's, then hovers 67 ticks while held, gravity 0.9x"},{"n":11,"name":"spider: to the roof and back","from":228,"to":254,"metrics":[{"m":"alive"}],"note":"sim: a tap teleports the spider to the roof at once (GD's spiderTestJumpInternal search), the next tap back to the floor"},{"n":12,"name":"swing: floor, roof, floor","from":254,"to":282,"metrics":[{"m":"accel"},{"m":"alive"}],"note":"sim: gravity flips a tick after each press, vy x0.8, gravity 0.086, limit 8"},{"n":13,"name":"ball up a 45-degree slope","from":282,"to":306,"metrics":[{"m":"yAt","at":[295,297]},{"m":"alive"}],"note":"no press: the ball rolls up 3 blocks of 45-degree slope, sim: held at the top a tick, then launched like the cube (7.405 x the ball's factor)","handsOff":true},{"n":14,"name":"ship up a 45-degree slope","from":306,"to":332,"metrics":[{"m":"yAt","at":[319,322]},{"m":"alive"}],"note":"no press: the ship slides up the slope and off its top: sim rides it like the cube and launches at the top","handsOff":true},{"n":15,"name":"teleport turned 0","from":332,"to":350,"metrics":[{"m":"dy","at":337},{"m":"alive"}],"note":"the cube walks into a teleport turned 0 degrees, key 54 = 150: sim moves it the full 150 straight up at any angle"},{"n":16,"name":"teleport turned 45","from":350,"to":368,"metrics":[{"m":"dy","at":355},{"m":"alive"}],"note":"the cube walks into a teleport turned 45 degrees, key 54 = 150: sim moves it the full 150 straight up at any angle"},{"n":17,"name":"teleport turned 90","from":368,"to":386,"metrics":[{"m":"dy","at":373},{"m":"alive"}],"note":"the cube walks into a teleport turned 90 degrees, key 54 = 150: sim moves it the full 150 straight up at any angle"},{"n":18,"name":"a block lifts the cube","from":386,"to":412,"metrics":[{"m":"yAt","at":[398,402]},{"m":"alive"}],"note":"the cube walks onto a 6-block platform; a move trigger lifts it 60 units over 0.5 s while the cube is on it. Sim: does not carry the player (the block pushes it up only as a landing); GD carries it"},{"n":19,"name":"green orb throw into the ground","from":412,"to":437,"metrics":[{"m":"launch","at":418},{"m":"alive"}],"note":"the route taps the green orb low over the floor: sim flips gravity and throws the cube DOWN (away from its new floor, the roof) into the ground, where it lives. GDLM 67: the game killed it 3 of 4 times. Then a blue portal puts gravity back"}],"objects":[[914,22,7.5,{"props":{"31":"MSBtaXJyb3I6IGRvZXMgdGhlIGp1bXAgY2hhbmdlPw==","32":"0.5"}}],
